# MASTER PROMPT: PREMIUM DENTAL CLINIC WEBSITE — COMPLETE FULL-STACK APPLICATION

Act as an award-winning healthcare UI/UX designer, senior full-stack developer, dental practice website consultant, brand identity designer, SEO specialist, accessibility expert, and security-focused software architect.

Build a complete, premium, modern, responsive dental clinic website designed to attract new patients, build trust, showcase dental treatments, and convert website visitors into appointment bookings.

The website must be suitable for independent dentists, multi-dentist clinics, orthodontic practices, cosmetic dentistry clinics, family dental practices, and international dental clinics.

Do not build a generic medical template or a static mockup. Create a complete, cohesive, functional application with professional branding, custom visual assets, multiple interconnected pages, secure appointment booking, database integration, patient communication workflows, an admin dashboard, and comprehensive SEO.

Use the temporary brand name "Luma Dental Studio". Keep the clinic name, logo, contact details, dentists, services, locations, appointment settings, currencies, and brand colors configurable so the website can be customized for different dental clients.

The final website should look like a premium international healthcare brand while remaining approachable, reassuring, professional, and easy to use.

## 1. WEBSITE OBJECTIVES

The website must help patients:

- Discover dental treatments and services.
- Learn about the clinic and its dentists.
- Understand available treatment options.
- Request or book appointments.
- Select an appropriate dentist, service, date, and available time.
- Receive booking confirmations and reminders when configured.
- Contact the clinic through phone, email, or WhatsApp where supported.
- Find the clinic's address, opening hours, and emergency contact guidance.
- Access patient information, forms, and policies.
- Navigate easily from any page to the booking form.

The website must also help clinic staff manage appointments, services, dentist profiles, enquiries, opening hours, and website content.

